PASS  17  rollback coverage, executor exclusivity and credential ownership are closed
          - 8 main external mutators derive eight reverse-order nodes; 11 fixed reconciliation observers; prefix replay forbidden
PASS  18  XUI broker composites and issuer-specific origin trust are exact
